paragraph.content:
by inserting after subparagraph (C) the following:“(D) ensure the professional integrity, including scientific integrity, of the discussion and analysis in an environmental document;
“(E) make use of reliable data and resources in carrying out this Act;
“(F) consistent with the provisions of this Act, study, develop, and describe technically and economically feasible alternatives;”
